484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (Our aqua background represents water and bath time, creating a calm setting that naturally fits our rubber duck concept. Butter yellow echoes the duck's appearance and is used to highlight buttons, selected states, and important actions. We use darker teal for text and outlines to provide contrast against our lighter backgrounds. Red, amber, and green are reserved for the duck's health states, keeping their meanings consistent and easy to recognize.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
