/E (We chose Manjari for its soft, rounded appearance, which matches the duck's friendly personality. We use different font sizes and weights to establish a clear visual hierarchy, with bold text emphasizing important numbers, scores, and actions.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
