/E (We use rounded buttons, simple icons, and consistent spacing to maintain a friendly and cohesive interface. Our design system includes reusable components with clearly defined states, such as active, inactive, and disabled, helping users recognize interactive elements and navigate the app more easily.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
490 0 obj
<<
