509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 315 0 R
/E (Despite the additional time and effort, we believe using Figma was worth it. It allowed us to create a more polished and consistent prototype that better communicates our design vision.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
510 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 315 0 R
/E (More importantly, having our screens built in Figma made it easier to connect interactions and demonstrate how users would navigate through our product. We felt that the quality of the final prototype and the ability to test interactive flows justified the extra development time.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
