<<
/Title (Cons: However, we underestimated how much time it would take to build everything in Figma. Creating and refining individual screens was significantly slower than we expected. We also encountered some unexpected alignment issues with our buttons, which we later corrected based on feedback.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1247 0 R
/Prev 1257 0 R
>>
